get.description:
Return the network topology graph for the organization.

Response format is vis-network compatible:
{
    "nodes": [{"id": ..., "label": ..., "group": ..., "ip": ..., "mac": ..., "asset_id": ...}],
    "edges": [{"from": ..., "to": ..., "label": ..., "link_type": ..., "source_port": ..., "target_port": ...}]
}
